  message: "PR #2354 (stable-id v19, 2026-11-23/24), types agent: the same mechanism in C#. `global::App.Model` and `App.Model` hash apart (types/RESULTS.md residual 12, \"like the Scala _root_ residual\"). The PR added FileTypeNames.root (C# `global::`, applied only before a built-in alias) and a root_optional flag (Rust: a leading `::` is dropped unless the head is declared/bound; diesel 6 ids moved). Either is the hook for Scala `_root_.` and for C# `global::` on a non-built-in path. Fixing moves ids: next scheme bump."  # 3bf5
